Package: rxode2nn
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Title: Neural-Network ODEs for 'rxode2' and 'nlmixr2'
Description: Embed neural networks inside ordinary differential equation
    right-hand sides for 'rxode2' and 'nlmixr2'. Networks are exposed as
    compiled 'rxode2' custom functions that supply the network value and
    its analytic input derivatives, allowing larger networks than the
    per-weight code-generation approach of 'pmxNODE'.
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Fidler", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "matthew.fidler@gmail.com")
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: rxode2, checkmate, stats
LinkingTo: rxode2, Rcpp
SystemRequirements: libtorch (via the 'torch' R package; C++17)
Suggests: nlmixr2, nlmixr2est, numDeriv, torch, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
